@startuml Subscription_Payment_Flow
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Subscription & Payment Flow

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 20
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    ActorBackgroundColor #4caf50
    RectangleBackgroundColor #37474f
    RectangleBorderColor #78909c
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
}

actor "User" as User #lightgreen

rectangle "Frontend Pages" {
    rectangle "Pricing\n[/pricing]" as Pricing {
        (Tier Comparison)
        (Lua Pack Options)
    }
    
    rectangle "Subscription\n[/subscription]" as SubPage {
        frame "Tab 1: Limits" {
            (Usage Progress Bars)
            (Quota Display)
            (Lua Balance)
        }
        frame "Tab 2: Upgrade" {
            (TierCard components)
            (LuaPackCard components)
        }
        frame "Tab 3: History" {
            (Payment Records)
            (Credit Transactions)
        }
    }
    
    rectangle "Payment Success\n[/payment/success]" as Success {
        (Order Details)
        (Redirect Timer)
    }
    
    rectangle "Payment Cancel\n[/payment/cancel]" as Cancel {
        (Retry Button)
        (Return Link)
    }
}

rectangle "Backend Services" {
    [PaymentController] as PayCtrl
    [PaymentService] as PaySvc
    [SubscriptionService] as SubSvc
    [CreditService] as CreditSvc
}

cloud "Payment Gateway" {
    [PayOS\n(Vietnam)] as PayOS
}

database "Database" {
    [payment_orders]
    [user_subscriptions]
    [user_credits]
    [credit_transactions]
}

' Subscription Purchase Flow
User --> Pricing : View Plans
Pricing --> PayCtrl : createSubscriptionPayment(tierCode)
PayCtrl --> PaySvc : Create payment order
PaySvc --> PayOS : Create checkout link
PayOS --> PaySvc : Return paymentUrl
PaySvc --> payment_orders : Save order (PENDING)
PaySvc --> User : Redirect to PayOS

' Lua Purchase Flow
User --> SubPage : Buy Lua Pack
SubPage --> PayCtrl : createLuaPackPayment(amount, price)
PayCtrl --> PaySvc : Create Lua payment
PaySvc --> PayOS : Create checkout link
PayOS --> User : Redirect to PayOS

' Payment Success (Webhook)
PayOS --> PayCtrl : POST /webhook (signed)
PayCtrl --> PaySvc : handleWebhook()
PaySvc --> PaySvc : verifyWebhookSignature()
PaySvc --> payment_orders : Update status (PAID)
PaySvc --> SubSvc : Activate subscription
PaySvc --> CreditSvc : Credit Lua to user
CreditSvc --> user_credits : Update balance
CreditSvc --> credit_transactions : Log transaction

' Frontend Success
PayOS --> Success : Redirect on success
Success --> SubPage : Auto redirect (3s)

' Frontend Cancel
PayOS --> Cancel : Redirect on cancel
Cancel --> Pricing : Try again

note right of PaySvc
  **PaymentService Methods:**
  - createSubscriptionPayment(userId, tierId)
  - createSubscriptionPaymentByCode(userId, tierCode)
  - createLuaPackPayment(userId, amount, price)
  - handleWebhook(webhook)
  - generateSignature(data) [HMAC-SHA256]
  - verifyWebhookSignature(webhook)
  - getOrderByCode(orderCode)
  - getPaymentHistory(userId, pageable)
  - isPayOSConfigured()
end note

note bottom of PayOS
  **Subscription Tiers:**
  - cramerie: Free (0 VND)
  - cramerich: 79,000 VND/mo
  - cramerous: 149,000 VND/mo
  
  **Lua Packs:**
  - lua_100: 10,000 VND
  - lua_500: 45,000 VND (+10% bonus)
  - lua_2000: 150,000 VND (+25% bonus)
end note

@enduml
